        🔴 WHY SCOPING MATTERS MORE ON LOI THAN IT DID ON NDA. An ACQUISITION LOI carries the
        approval flags that gate PSA entry (Underwriting_Approved_Before_LOI,
        Approved_LOI_Before_PSA). An object-wide read here would hand the disposition personas
        the acquisition approval surface, which is the NDA compounding error repeated on a
        higher-value object.

        🔴 THIS SET IS AGAIN THE REASON A SECOND SHARING RULE EXISTS - identical reasoning to the
