        no LOIs". Post-deploy gate, verified AS THE PERSONA, not as an administrator.
        🔴 Deploy sharing rules ONE AT A TIME - a batch rolls all of them back in this org.

        FLS MIRRORS DPEG_Disposition_Edit'S FIELD LIST AT editable=false THROUGHOUT, INCLUDING
