        NDA__c.Is_Decline_Allowed__c IS GRANTED READ HERE TOO, even though this persona cannot
        press Mark Declined. The field backs a flexipage visibility rule, and a rule referencing
        a field the running user cannot read evaluates FALSE rather than erroring - so withholding
        it would silently change what this persona sees on the page for a reason unrelated to
        their access level. Read is the honest grant.

        🔴 A PermissionSet DEPLOY REPLACES THIS SET'S ENTIRE GRANT LIST - it does not merge, and
        an org-side-only grant not represented here is wiped by the next deploy of this file.
        ⚠ THAT RECONCILIATION WAS NOT PERFORMED FOR THIS EDIT: a retrieve of this set from
        usman-dpeg on 2026-08-09 did not return it. The likely explanation is that 3A is not
        deployed and it does not yet exist there (D14) - an inference, NOT a measurement.
        Confirm before deploy.
    -->
