        Opportunity__c IS GRANTED READ HERE TOO, even though this persona edits nothing. It is a
        SELECT field in ContractReviewSelector.selectOpportunityIdRequiredById and
        .selectByOpportunityIds, both WITH USER_MODE, and USER_MODE throws rather than degrading on
